            "review_text": "HK\nDa Nang, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nThe dive bar I was looking for in An Thuong\nMar 2026 • Solo\nIf you’re tired of overpriced, fancy hotel bars, this is your sanctuary. Last Hope is raw, gritty, and authentic. I spent a whole night here talking with other expats and the staff. Great music, strong drinks, and a real \"Never Give Up\" vibe. Definitely the coolest hideout in Da Nang.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 26, 2026\nLast Hope\nGlad you get exactly what we're about. We definitely prefer keeping things raw and authentic over being fancy. Catch you later at the hideout for another drink!\nRead more\nWritten May 3, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
